user_prompt_template:
CHAPTER PLAN:
{current_chapter_json}

CHAPTER NARRATIVE (read carefully — your artifacts must directly serve this content):
{chapter_narrative}

PROJECT CONTEXT:
Tutorial Request: {life_event}
Document: {document_title}
Skill Level: {audience}
Output Style: {tone}
Tutorial Type: {formatting_profile}
Depth / Code Preference: {artifact_density}
Context:
{context}

Design exercises and checklists for {domain_name}. Every artifact must directly serve the tutorial content above and feel custom-built for {life_event}.

For each worksheet listed in the chapter plan, decide its format:
  -> Collecting similar implementation data, commands, files, APIs, env vars, or deployment settings = "table"
  -> Verifying discrete setup/build/debug/deploy actions = "checklist"
  -> Comparing options, states, symptoms, or responsibilities = "two-column"
  -> Planning, debugging, reviewing, or journaling implementation details = "form"

Repeat-use and cross-reference fields are required on every worksheet:
  repeat_use: true if reused during development/debugging/deployment; false for one-time setup.
  cross_references: exact titles of artifacts whose output feeds into this one.

Return ONLY the following JSON object. No prose. No markdown. No code fences.

{{
  "chapter_number": {chapter_number},
  "domain_id": "domain ID from the chapter plan",
  "chapter_title": "Chapter title from the plan",
  "worksheets": [
    {{
      "id": "ws-{chapter_number:02d}-a",
      "title": "Exact title from chapter plan",
      "layout": "table | checklist | two-column | form",
      "purpose": "One sentence: the specific learning, implementation, debugging, or verification outcome this artifact supports",
      "estimated_completion_time": "Realistic estimate, e.g. '10 minutes during setup' or '20 minutes before deploy'",
      "common_errors": ["Tutorial-specific mistake 1 with symptom", "Tutorial-specific mistake 2 with symptom"],

      "table_columns": ["Specific command/file/API/env var/deployment column header"],
      "table_row_count": 10,
      "sample_rows": [{{"Column Header 1": "Realistic stack-specific value", "Column Header 2": "Expected output or note"}}],

      "checklist_items": ["Verify [exact thing] by [where/how to check] — pass = [condition], fail = [next debugging action]"],
      "example_items": ["Example of a fully completed, correctly verified checklist item"],

      "left_column_label": "Label for left comparison column",
      "right_column_label": "Label for right comparison column",

      "sections": [
        {{
          "section_id": "s-01",
          "section_title": "Specific section title naming the learning/build/debug function",
          "instructions": "Before completing this section, run or inspect the specific files, commands, UI states, or logs needed. This section is complete when the stated verification condition passes.",
          "fields": [
            {{
              "field_id": "f-001",
              "label": "Stack-specific field label",
              "type": "text | textarea | date | number | boolean | select | multi-select",
              "placeholder": "Realistic example for this tutorial",
              "required": true,
              "validation_hint": "Example of a correct, complete entry",
              "options": []
            }}
          ]
        }}
      ],
      "decision_gates": [
        {{
          "gate_id": "g-01",
          "gate_title": "Gate name",
          "condition": "Specific verifiable condition from the tutorial",
          "pass_action": "What to do when condition is met",
          "fail_action": "What to inspect or change when condition is not met",
          "blocks_completion": true
        }}
      ],
      "repeat_use": false,
      "cross_references": []
    }}
  ]
}}
